BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Day of Meditative Play
DTSTART:20261024T123000
DTEND:20261024T180000
DTSTAMP:20261024T143931Z
UID:a3dd0fae1a8944cd90e9bf063d9010@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Create time for yourself to just be in nature. This gentle med
 iation practice only requires you to be present. You have all of the exper
 ience that you need. All are welcome to join me in a gentle Mindful Outdoo
 r Experience that invites us to slow down\, engage our sense and experienc
 e connection with the natural world through presence\, reciprocity and sen
 sory awareness. Participants should bring a blanket or cushion that allows
  them to comfortably sit on the ground. If sitting on the ground is not an
  option then they should bring a chair. The entire experience will be held
  outdoors\, so bring what is needed to be comfortable\, including extra la
 yers\, bug spray\, water\, sunblock. We will not be traveling very far at 
 all\, but there may be walking so comfortable shoes are recommended.\n\nSo
 urces: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Creative Healing and Fitness\, 518 Main St
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/a-day-of-m
 editative-play-16-10-2026-12-52-22
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bassoonist Scott Pool & EK Duo
DTSTART:20261024T170000
DTEND:20261024T180000
DTSTAMP:20261024T143931Z
UID:01f1aa7d533cb6ae9f1c065a61ced6@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Upstream Classical presents bassoonist Scott Pool & EK Duo per
 forming unusual and off-the-beaten path music for two bassoons and percuss
 ion. Folk\, pop & classical elements blend together in novel ways with wor
 ks by Louis Andriessen\, Billie Eilish and EK Duo's own Thomas Kozumplik\,
  who is featured on steel drum. EK Duo is a project of longtime Clogs' ban
 dmates\, percussionist Thomas Kozumplik and bassoonist Rachael Elliott. Sc
 ott Pool\, based in Corpus Christi\, is the Academy Director of the Talis 
 Music Festival & Academy in Sarajevo\, Bosnia and Herzegovina and has tour
 ed widely across the Americas\, Europe and Asia. EK Duo first performed wi
 th Scott in 2024 while touring Texas and are delighted to collaborate with
  him on his first shows in Vermont. By donation\; free for students & chil
 dren\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Unitarian Church Montpelier\, 130 Main St.
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/bassoonist
 -scott-pool-ek-duo-06-10-2026-11-47-09
END:VEVENT
