BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Effective prayer: Finding healing and wholeness in divine Love
DTSTART:20261024T103000
DTEND:20261024T113000
DTSTAMP:20261024T143931Z
UID:7b1b52d5a5012b8d226e3a3d52e77d@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:In this lecture\, explore practical and transformative prayer
 \, as taught in Christian Science. Through compelling personal stories\, C
 hristian Science practitioner and lecturer Bobby Lewis illustrates how the
  spiritual laws of divine Love operate– and how prayer brings us into al
 ignment with these laws. Whether you’re feeling lost or struggling with 
 illness\, effective prayer can restore clarity\, peace and wholeness in ev
 ery area of life.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:First Church of Christ\, Scientist\, Burlington\, 420 S. Union St
 .
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/effective-
 prayer-finding-healing-and-wholeness-in-divine-love-15-10-2026-12-04-24
END:VEVENT
