BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Film Screening: The Dawnland Kitchen
DTSTART:20261024T160000
DTEND:20261024T170000
DTSTAMP:20261024T143931Z
UID:8f8c18f7f9464c5d1612ee69e47b22@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Join the Vermont Commission on Native American Affairs for a f
 ree\, public screening of the documentary short\, The Dawnland Kitchen\, a
 t the Capitol Theater in Downtown Montpelier\, Vermont. Following the 15-m
 inute film\, there will be a 45-minute facilitated discussion with the fil
 m's subject\, Missisquoi Chef Jessee Lawyer\, and it's director\, Scott Ch
 erhoniak. Admission is free\, but capacity is limited to 50 people. Ticket
 s are first come\, first served. Doors open at 3:30. Questions? Please con
 tact Breanna Sheehan at breanna.sheehan@vermont.gov.\n\nSources: Vermont P
 ublic
LOCATION:Capitol Theater\, 93 State St
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/film-scree
 ning-the-dawnland-kitchen-29-09-2026-17-03-44
END:VEVENT
